            "review_title": "Review at The Vault Bar & Lounge",
            "review_text": "BJ H\n3 contributions\n1\nHidden Gem\nFeb 2020 • Couples\nI like this place; I found the staff to be very friendly and helpful ordering food and drinks. Had some appetizers, the chicken wings came with a dipping sauce that was super Asian good, full of lemongrass and garlic. The potato was so creamy and had a nice crunch to it. The spring rolls were also worth ordering. Bartenders are good at mixing the drinks, so all is good here. Recommend to visit.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 9, 2020",
            "rating": 5.0,
