            "review_text": "Adeline\nSingapore, Singapore1 contribution\n0\nExcellent Bar\nDec 2019\nWent on a friend's recommendation. Location quite easy to find as nearby tourist attractions. Food was surprising good. What stand out for me was the friendly service and the ambient of the place. They had a wide range of drinks, especially enjoyed the cocktails! Generally a gerat place to chill out! Would visit again when back to Ho Chi Minh.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten January 3, 2020",
